{"sha": "0c388308a9ef4034bdc1d6c77a837c58a053eab6510210ab499e8eee969e5af3", "body": ["\\textbf{7.} $E_{\\text{a}}/k_BT = 134$：$D \\approx 10^{-62}\\,\\unit{m^2/s}$；单个", "间距（\\qty{0.25}{nm}）对应 $a^2/D \\sim 10^{43}\\,\\unit{s}$：冻结。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $E_{\\text{a}}/k_BT = 32.8$：$D = \\qty{4.3e-19}{m^2/s}$；$\\sqrt{Dt} =", "\\qty{28}{nm}$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $n_0\\operatorname{erfc}(x/2\\sqrt{Dt})$；$n_B/n_0 = 5 \\times 10^{-6}$：", "$x \\approx 6.4\\sqrt{Dt} = \\qty{0.18}{\\micro m}$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $2n_0\\sqrt{Dt/\\pi} = \\qty{6.3e18}{m^{-2}}$：为 $Q$ 的六倍 ---", "剂量随 $\\sqrt t$ 增长，并由时间决定。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 低温：$D$ 小，剂量由时间控制，", "浅；高温下，固定剂量被迅速推向深处。", "", "\\textbf{12.} \\qty{0.18}{\\micro m} 对比 \\qty{1.3}{\\micro m}：过薄。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $4 \\times 10^{18}$ 个分子；$n_{\\text{a}} = \\qty{2.4e25}{m^{-3}}$。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $\\ell = \\qty{37}{nm}$；$v^* = \\qty{206}{m/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $D \\approx \\qty{2.5e-6}{m^2/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $L^2/D = 10^7\\,\\unit{s}$，为数月；漂移：\\qty{50}{s}。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $n = 8N(4\\pi Dt)^{-3/2}\\eu^{-r^2/4Dt}$；极大值位于 $t^* = r^2/6D =", "\\qty{6.7e4}{s}$ 处，即十八小时。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $n_{\\max} = 8N(4\\pi Dt^*)^{-3/2}\\eu^{-3/2} \\approx \\qty{2e18}{m^{-3}}$，", "远高于阈值，最终可以熔炼。", "", "\\textbf{19.} $r^2 = 4Dt\\ln 10^6 = \\qty{12}{m^2}$：\\qty{3.5}{m}。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $v^*t/\\ell \\approx 5 \\times 10^{14}$。", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\langle x\\rangle = 0$，$\\langle x^2\\rangle = N\\ell^2 = \\ell^2 t/\\tau$；", "$D = \\ell^2/2\\tau$。", "", "\\textbf{22.} $\\binom{N}{N/2}/2^N$：$1/2$、$3/8$、$5/16$ --- 递减", "（近似为 $1/\\sqrt{\\pi N/2}$）：行走者的偏离量按 $\\sqrt N$ 增长。", "", "\\textbf{23.} 云团自行聚集成一点 --- 从未观察到；它", "违反的是扩散方程，而非力学定律。", "", "\\textbf{24.} 每次碰撞都是可逆的，但初始态（所有粒子聚在一起）", "是特殊的：几乎每一条由此出发的微观历程都会扩散，", "而其逆过程需要所有速度的协同配合。随机行走的平均", "只保留典型行为，丢弃了这部分信息；", "不可逆性是统计性的。", "", "\\textbf{25.} $L \\sim \\sqrt{Dt}$，$t \\sim L^2/D$；$D \\sim \\ell v^*/3$，即", "碰撞之间的步长：$10^{-5}$、$10^{-9}$、$10^{-17}\\,\\unit{m^2/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}